        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britney Spears, James Stewart, Selena Gomez, Madonna, Patrick Leonard\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", \"La Isla Bonita\"\n- Topics: songwriting, Latin pop influence\n\nFacts:\n- Britney Spears and James Stewart wrote \"Rock Me In,\" \"Whiplash,\" and one other song.\n- \"Whiplash\" is a song by Selena Gomez & the Scene.\n- The other song written by Britney Spears and James Stewart has a Latin pop influence.\n- \"La Isla Bonita\" is a song by Madonna with a similar Latin pop influence.\n- Madonna co-wrote and co-produced \"La Isla Bonita\" with Patrick Leonard.",
